{"slug": "breakout", "name": "벽돌깨기", "keywords": ["벽돌깨기", "벽돌 깨기", "벽돌", "breakout", "brick", "블록깨기"], "prompt": "클래식 벽돌깨기 게임을 만들어줘. 패들로 공을 튕겨 벽돌을 깨고, 스테이지 3개, 목숨 3개, 점수와 최고점, 파워업(패들 확대) 하나. 파스텔 톤 스타일.", "description": "클래식 벽돌깨기 게임을 만들었어요. 3개의 스테이지(난이도 상승, 일부 단단한 벽돌 포함), 목숨 3개, 점수/최고점수(로컬저장), 패들이 커지는 파워업 캡슐, 파스텔 톤 벽돌 컬러를 구현했습니다. PC는 키보드/마우스, 모바일은 화면 하단 좌우 이동 버튼과 발사 버튼(또는 캔버스 터치 드래그)으로 조작할 수 있어요.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head><script>(function(){var t0=Date.now();function post(n,d){try{parent.postMessage({type:'aj:event',name:String(n),data:d==null?null:d,t:Date.now()-t0},'*')}catch(e){}}window.AJ={event:post,start:function(d){post('start',d)},score:function(s){post('score',{score:Number(s)||0})},over:function(s){post('over',{score:Number(s)||0})},level:function(l){post('level',{level:l})},restart:function(){post('restart')}};window.addEventListener('load',function(){post('load')});var first=false;['keydown','pointerdown','touchstart'].forEach(function(ev){window.addEventListener(ev,function(){if(!first){first=true;post('first_input')}},{passive:true})});})();</script><script>try{window.localStorage.getItem('__t')}catch(e){(function(){var m={};var s={getItem:function(k){return k in m?m[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){m[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete m[k]},clear:function(){m={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(m)[i]||null},get length(){return Object.keys(m).length}};try{Object.defineProperty(window,'localStorage',{value:s,configurable:true})}catch(_){}try{Object.defineProperty(window,'sessionStorage',{value:s,configurable:true})}catch(_){}})()}</script>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n<title>파스텔 벽돌깨기</title>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n    background: #000; overflow: hidden;\n    touch-action: none;\n    -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  }\n  #wrap {\n    position: fixed; inset: 0;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    background: #000;\n  }\n  #gameCanvas {\n    background: #fff;\n    display: block;\n    touch-action: none;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    position: fixed;\n    bottom: 18px;\n    width: 62px; height: 62px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);\n    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    touch-action: none;\n    -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n  .btn:active { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }\n  #leftBtn { left: 18px; }\n  #rightBtn { left: 92px; }\n  #actionBtn { right: 18px; width: 78px; height: 78px; font-size: 15px; }\n  #touchControls { display: none; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"wrap\">\n  <canvas id=\"gameCanvas\"></canvas>\n</div>\n<div id=\"touchControls\">\n  <div class=\"btn\" id=\"leftBtn\">◀</div>\n  <div class=\"btn\" id=\"rightBtn\">▶</div>\n  <div class=\"btn\" id=\"actionBtn\">발사</div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  const GAME_W = 480, GAME_H = 640;\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('gameCanvas');\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n  canvas.width = GAME_W;\n  canvas.height = GAME_H;\n\n  // ---------- 반응형 스케일링 ----------\n  function resize(){\n    const scale = Math.min(window.innerWidth / GAME_W, window.innerHeight / GAME_H);\n    canvas.style.width = (GAME_W * scale) + 'px';\n    canvas.style.height = (GAME_H * scale) + 'px';\n  }\n  window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n  resize();\n\n  // ---------- 터치 감지 ----------\n  const isTouch = ('ontouchstart' in window) || navigator.maxTouchPoints > 0;\n  if (isTouch) document.getElementById('touchControls').style.display = 'block';\n\n  // ---------- 색상 팔레트 (파스텔) ----------\n  const PASTELS = ['#FFB3BA','#FFDFBA','#FFFFBA','#BAFFC9','#BAE1FF','#E0BBE4','#C7CEEA'];\n  const HARD_COLOR = '#9AA0C9';\n  const HARD_DAMAGED = '#C9CDE8';\n  const BG = '#FDF6F0';\n\n  // ---------- 상태 ----------\n  let state = 'start'; // start, playing, stageClear, gameover, win\n  let score = 0;\n  let highScore = parseInt(localStorage.getItem('brickHighScore') || '0');\n  let lives = 3;\n  let stage = 1;\n  const MAX_STAGE = 3;\n\n  // ---------- 패들 ----------\n  const paddle = {\n    w: 80, h: 14, baseW: 80, bigW: 130,\n    x: GAME_W/2 - 40, y: GAME_H - 40,\n    speed: 480,\n    powerTimer: 0\n  };\n\n  // ---------- 공 ----------\n  const ball = {\n    x: 0, y: 0, r: 8,\n    dx: 0, dy: 0, speed: 260,\n    attached: true\n  };\n\n  // ---------- 벽돌 ----------\n  let bricks = [];\n  const cols = 8;\n  const brickPad = 6;\n  const brickW = (GAME_W - 40 - (cols-1)*brickPad) / cols;\n  const brickH = 22;\n\n  // ---------- 파워업 캡슐 ----------\n  let powerups = [];\n\n  function buildStage(s){\n    bricks = [];\n    powerups = [];\n    let rows = 3 + s; // stage1:4, stage2:5, stage3:6\n    let offsetLeft = 20;\n    let offsetTop = 60;\n    for (let r = 0; r < rows; r++){\n      for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++){\n        let hard = false;\n        // 스테이지 3에서 상단 두 줄은 단단한 벽돌\n        if (s === 3 && r < 2) hard = true;\n        if (s === 2 && r === 0 && Math.random() < 0.4) hard = true;\n        bricks.push({\n          x: offsetLeft + c*(brickW+brickPad),\n          y: offsetTop + r*(brickH+brickPad),\n          w: brickW, h: brickH,\n          alive: true,\n          hp: hard ? 2 : 1,\n          maxHp: hard ? 2 : 1,\n          color: hard ? HARD_COLOR : PASTELS[(r+c) % PASTELS.length]\n        });\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  function resetBallOnPaddle(){\n    ball.attached = true;\n    ball.x = paddle.x + paddle.w/2;\n    ball.y = paddle.y - ball.r - 1;\n    ball.dx = 0;\n    ball.dy = 0;\n    ball.speed = 260 + (stage-1)*40;\n  }\n\n  function launchBall(){\n    if (!ball.attached) return;\n    ball.attached = false;\n    const angle = (-Math.PI/2) + (Math.random()*0.6 - 0.3);\n    ball.dx = Math.cos(angle) * ball.speed;\n    ball.dy = Math.sin(angle) * ball.speed;\n  }\n\n  function startGame(){\n    score = 0;\n    lives = 3;\n    stage = 1;\n    paddle.w = paddle.baseW;\n    paddle.powerTimer = 0;\n    paddle.x = GAME_W/2 - paddle.w/2;\n    buildStage(stage);\n    resetBallOnPaddle();\n    state = 'playing';\n  }\n\n  function nextStage(){\n    stage++;\n    if (stage > MAX_STAGE){\n      state = 'win';\n      return;\n    }\n    paddle.w = paddle.baseW;\n    paddle.powerTimer = 0;\n    paddle.x = GAME_W/2 - paddle.w/2;\n    buildStage(stage);\n    resetBallOnPaddle();\n    state = 'playing';\n  }\n\n  function loseLife(){\n    lives--;\n    if (lives <= 0){\n      state = 'gameover';\n      if (score > highScore){\n        highScore = score;\n        localStorage.setItem('brickHighScore', String(highScore));\n      }\n    } else {\n      resetBallOnPaddle();\n    }\n  }\n\n  // ---------- 입력 ----------\n  const keys = {};\n  window.addEventListener('keydown', e => {\n    keys[e.key] = true;\n    if (e.key === ' ' || e.key === 'ArrowUp'){\n      handleAction();\n      e.preventDefault();\n    }\n  });\n  window.addEventListener('keyup', e => { keys[e.key] = false; });\n\n  function handleAction(){\n    if (state === 'start') startGame();\n    else if (state === 'playing') launchBall();\n    else if (state === 'stageClear') nextStage();\n    else if (state === 'gameover' || state === 'win') startGame();\n  }\n\n  canvas.addEventListener('mousedown', () => handleAction());\n  canvas.addEventListener('mousemove', e => {\n    const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const scaleX = GAME_W / rect.width;\n    let mx = (e.clientX - rect.left) * scaleX;\n    paddle.x = mx - paddle.w/2;\n  });\n\n  // 캔버스 직접 드래그 (터치)\n  canvas.addEventListener('touchmove', e => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const scaleX = GAME_W / rect.width;\n    const t = e.touches[0];\n    let mx = (t.clientX - rect.left) * scaleX;\n    paddle.x = mx - paddle.w/2;\n  }, {passive:false});\n  canvas.addEventListener('touchstart', e => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    handleAction();\n  }, {passive:false});\n\n  // 터치 버튼\n  let touchLeft = false, touchRight = false;\n  function bindBtn(id, onDown, onUp){\n    const el = document.getElementById(id);\n    el.addEventListener('pointerdown', e => { e.preventDefault(); onDown(); });\n    el.addEventListener('pointerup', e => { e.preventDefault(); onUp && onUp(); });\n    el.addEventListener('pointercancel', e => { onUp && onUp(); });\n    el.addEventListener('pointerleave', e => { onUp && onUp(); });\n    el.addEventListener('contextmenu', e => e.preventDefault());\n  }\n  bindBtn('leftBtn', () => touchLeft = true, () => touchLeft = false);\n  bindBtn('rightBtn', () => touchRight = true, () => touchRight = false);\n  bindBtn('actionBtn', () => handleAction());\n\n  // ---------- 게임 루프 ----------\n  let lastTime = performance.now();\n  function loop(now){\n    const dt = Math.min((now - lastTime) / 1000, 0.033);\n    lastTime = now;\n    update(dt);\n    render();\n    requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n  }\n\n  function update(dt){\n    if (state !== 'playing') return;\n\n    // 패들 이동\n    let dir = 0;\n    if (keys['ArrowLeft'] || keys['a'] || keys['A'] || touchLeft) dir -= 1;\n    if (keys['ArrowRight'] || keys['d'] || keys['D'] || touchRight) dir += 1;\n    paddle.x += dir * paddle.speed * dt;\n    paddle.x = Math.max(0, Math.min(GAME_W - paddle.w, paddle.x));\n\n    // 파워업 타이머\n    if (paddle.powerTimer > 0){\n      paddle.powerTimer -= dt;\n      if (paddle.powerTimer <= 0){\n        paddle.w = paddle.baseW;\n        if (paddle.x + paddle.w > GAME_W) paddle.x = GAME_W - paddle.w;\n      }\n    }\n\n    // 공\n    if (ball.attached){\n      ball.x = paddle.x + paddle.w/2;\n      ball.y = paddle.y - ball.r - 1;\n    } else {\n      ball.x += ball.dx * dt;\n      ball.y += ball.dy * dt;\n\n      if (ball.x - ball.r < 0){ ball.x = ball.r; ball.dx *= -1; }\n      if (ball.x + ball.r > GAME_W){ ball.x = GAME_W - ball.r; ball.dx *= -1; }\n      if (ball.y - ball.r < 0){ ball.y = ball.r; ball.dy *= -1; }\n\n      // 패들 충돌\n      if (ball.dy > 0 &&\n          ball.y + ball.r >= paddle.y &&\n          ball.y + ball.r <= paddle.y + paddle.h + 10 &&\n          ball.x >= paddle.x && ball.x <= paddle.x + paddle.w){\n        ball.y = paddle.y - ball.r;\n        const hitPos = (ball.x - (paddle.x + paddle.w/2)) / (paddle.w/2); // -1 ~ 1\n        const angle = hitPos * (Math.PI/3) - Math.PI/2; // -90 +- 60deg\n        const speed = Math.hypot(ball.dx, ball.dy);\n        ball.dx = Math.cos(angle) * speed;\n        ball.dy = Math.sin(angle) * speed;\n      }\n\n      // 바닥으로 떨어짐\n      if (ball.y - ball.r > GAME_H){\n        loseLife();\n      }\n\n      // 벽돌 충돌\n      for (let b of bricks){\n        if (!b.alive) continue;\n        if (ball.x + ball.r > b.x && ball.x - ball.r < b.x + b.w &&\n            ball.y + ball.r > b.y && ball.y - ball.r < b.y + b.h){\n          // 충돌 방향 판정 (단순화: 이전 위치 기반)\n          const overlapX = Math.min(ball.x + ball.r - b.x, b.x + b.w - (ball.x - ball.r));\n          const overlapY = Math.min(ball.y + ball.r - b.y, b.y + b.h - (ball.y - ball.r));\n          if (overlapX < overlapY){\n            ball.dx *= -1;\n          } else {\n            ball.dy *= -1;\n          }\n          b.hp--;\n          if (b.hp <= 0){\n            b.alive = false;\n            score += 10 * stage;\n            // 파워업 드랍 확률\n            if (Math.random() < 0.15){\n              powerups.push({ x: b.x + b.w/2, y: b.y + b.h/2, r: 10, dy: 120 });\n            }\n          } else {\n            b.color = HARD_DAMAGED;\n          }\n          break;\n        }\n      }\n\n      // 스테이지 클리어 체크\n      if (bricks.every(b => !b.alive)){\n        state = 'stageClear';\n      }\n    }\n\n    // 파워업 낙하 & 패들 캐치\n    for (let i = powerups.length - 1; i >= 0; i--){\n      const p = powerups[i];\n      p.y += p.dy * dt;\n      if (p.y - p.r > GAME_H){\n        powerups.splice(i,1);\n        continue;\n      }\n      if (p.y + p.r >= paddle.y && p.y - p.r <= paddle.y + paddle.h &&\n          p.x >= paddle.x && p.x <= paddle.x + paddle.w){\n        paddle.w = paddle.bigW;\n        paddle.powerTimer = 8;\n        if (paddle.x + paddle.w > GAME_W) paddle.x = GAME_W - paddle.w;\n        powerups.splice(i,1);\n      }\n    }\n\n    if (score > highScore) highScore = score;\n  }\n\n  // ---------- 렌더 ----------\n  function render(){\n    ctx.clearRect(0,0,GAME_W,GAME_H);\n    ctx.fillStyle = BG;\n    ctx.fillRect(0,0,GAME_W,GAME_H);\n\n    if (state === 'start'){\n      drawCenterScreen('🧱 파스텔 벽돌깨기', ['스페이스 / 클릭 / 발사 버튼으로 시작'], '#7A6A85');\n      drawHighScore();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    // 벽돌\n    for (let b of bricks){\n      if (!b.alive) continue;\n      ctx.fillStyle = b.color;\n      roundRect(b.x, b.y, b.w, b.h, 5);\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.6)';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n      ctx.stroke();\n    }\n\n    // 파워업\n    for (let p of powerups){\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#FFD93D';\n      ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, p.r, 0, Math.PI*2);\n      ctx.fill();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#8a6d00';\n      ctx.font = '12px sans-serif';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.fillText('P', p.x, p.y+4);\n    }\n\n    // 패들\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#A6D8FF';\n    roundRect(paddle.x, paddle.y, paddle.w, paddle.h, 7);\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#7BB8E8';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n    ctx.stroke();\n\n    // 공\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#FF8FA3';\n    ctx.arc(ball.x, ball.y, ball.r, 0, Math.PI*2);\n    ctx.fill();\n\n    // HUD\n    drawHUD();\n\n    if (state === 'stageClear'){\n      drawCenterScreen(`스테이지 ${stage} 클리어!`, ['탭 / 스페이스로 다음 스테이지'], '#5B8C5A');\n    } else if (state === 'gameover'){\n      drawCenterScreen('게임 오버', [`점수: ${score}`, '탭 / 스페이스로 재시작'], '#C0507A');\n    } else if (state === 'win'){\n      drawCenterScreen('🎉 축하합니다! 클리어! 🎉', [`최종 점수: ${score}`, '탭 / 스페이스로 재시작'], '#C99A2E');\n    }\n  }\n\n  function roundRect(x,y,w,h,r){\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.moveTo(x+r, y);\n    ctx.arcTo(x+w, y, x+w, y+h, r);\n    ctx.arcTo(x+w, y+h, x, y+h, r);\n    ctx.arcTo(x, y+h, x, y, r);\n    ctx.arcTo(x, y, x+w, y, r);\n    ctx.closePath();\n  }\n\n  function drawHUD(){\n    ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#6b5b73';\n    ctx.font = 'bold 16px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillText('점수: ' + score, 12, 22);\n    ctx.fillText('최고: ' + highScore, 12, 42);\n\n    ctx.textAlign = 'right';\n    ctx.fillText('스테이지 ' + stage + '/' + MAX_STAGE, GAME_W - 12, 22);\n\n    // 목숨 하트\n    ctx.textAlign = 'right';\n    let heartStr = '';\n    for (let i=0;i<lives;i++) heartStr += '❤';\n    ctx.font = '18px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#FF6B81';\n    ctx.fillText(heartStr, GAME_W - 12, 42);\n  }\n\n  function drawHighScore(){\n    ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#7A6A85';\n    ctx.font = 'bold 16px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillText('최고 점수: ' + highScore, GAME_W/2, GAME_H/2 + 60);\n  }\n\n  function drawCenterScreen(title, lines, color){\n    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.85)';\n    ctx.fillRect(0, GAME_H/2 - 90, GAME_W, 180);\n    ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n    ctx.fillStyle = color;\n    ctx.font = 'bold 28px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillText(title, GAME_W/2, GAME_H/2 - 20);\n    ctx.font = '16px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#555';\n    lines.forEach((line, i) => {\n      ctx.fillText(line, GAME_W/2, GAME_H/2 + 15 + i*24);\n    });\n  }\n\n  requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"}